# Canonical authorship.
#
# This repository has one living contributor. Commits had landed under agent-run
# identities (`Proteus Test`, `Proteus`, `Claude`), under a malformed noreply
# address git never validated, under GitHub's web-UI committer, and under two
# further personal addresses. None of them was a separate person.
#
# The history was REWRITTEN on 2026-08-17 (`git filter-repo --mailmap`, this
# file) so every commit's author and committer is the identity below, and every
# agent co-author trailer is gone. Commit hashes therefore changed and `origin`
# was force-pushed; the pre-rewrite object graph is preserved at
# `~/.cache/proteus-handoff/pre-rewrite-all-refs.bundle`.
#
# The file is kept, not deleted: it is the declaration a future commit made from
# a different machine or a web edit is measured against, and it keeps every git
# tool's view canonical without a second rewrite.

